          <h3 class="font-serif" style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-top: 8px;">DISCOVERY SET</h3>
          <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 8px;">5 x 5ml atomizers + ₹4,500 full bottle voucher.</p>
